repo: boxscore-prophet (from frontmatter). No graphics produced -- nothing in the draft could be verified against a boxscore-prophet artifact.

What boxscore-prophet has: player-level fantasy outputs (start boards, boom boards, ECR gaps, ledgers, scored slates, movers) for QB/RB/WR/TE, plus a game slate with weather/venue only (10b_game_slate_2026_w11.csv). It has no team-level EPA, SRS, standings, division records, tiebreaker inputs, point differentials, strength of schedule, CPOE, or market spreads/totals.

Every claim in the draft is a team-level or NFL-stat claim, so none have a matching artifact. No week-12 files exist yet either (latest outputs are w11).

